{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And while I was yet speaking and praying</b> — words that were not written, and casting my supplication; therefore he needed to say a second time, \"and while I was speaking in prayer.\"" "<b>And the meaning of מועף</b> — as if he said \"cause to fly,\" for it was compelled to fly."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:20:40.265921257Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}